{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108260","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910826001:1":{"text":"这玩意……咱做的，也、也不是，是咱和<style=st...","source_cn":"这玩意……咱做的，也、也不是，是咱和<style=st...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910826002:1":{"text":"总之，给你，戴不戴随你。","source_cn":"总之，给你，戴不戴随你。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x29AABA8260564F4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910826003:1":{"text":"……好美的月亮！你们什么时候做了这么漂亮的饰品出来？","source_cn":"……好美的月亮！你们什么时候做了这么漂亮的饰品出来？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA58708F11F878D75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910826004:1":{"text":"咱……呃，总之……咱想说……之前很多事，对不起。","source_cn":"咱……呃，总之……咱想说……之前很多事，对不起。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x9A03E3DBD898A45E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910826005:1":{"text":"——就、就这样了！别想听咱说第二次！","source_cn":"——就、就这样了！别想听咱说第二次！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xD4B474C45F566FD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910826006:1":{"text":"我很喜欢。真的，很喜欢！谢谢你们！","source_cn":"我很喜欢。真的，很喜欢！谢谢你们！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x1C1F6E35C41097C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910826007:1":{"text":"这是你们送我的幸运符，是家人亲手制作的宝贵礼物！","source_cn":"这是你们送我的幸运符，是家人亲手制作的宝贵礼物！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x7979CB72A3995399","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910826008:1":{"text":"我会一直戴着它，永远永远都不摘下来！","source_cn":"我会一直戴着它，永远永远都不摘下来！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x256F1D18CC097FB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910826009:1":{"text":"是啊，家人赠送的珍贵宝物，要永永远远保存下来。","source_cn":"是啊，家人赠送的珍贵宝物，要永永远远保存下来。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xDBDFB20E46862B8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910826010:1":{"text":"可惜，凡人终有一天会消失，“永远”只是个谎言。多么悲伤啊。","source_cn":"可惜，凡人终有一天会消失，“永远”只是个谎言。多么悲伤啊。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x4671A9705144E6EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910826011:1":{"text":"……图澜？","source_cn":"……图澜？","status":"h